Hello All,

please correct me if I'm wrong, but after checking the sources I found
that there is (nearly) no provision for power management in BlueZ.

Because we're currently working on a mobile device where power management
is essential we like to add at least some minimal power managment stuff.
However, may be someone is already working on this and we don't want to
reinvent the wheel.

So, if anybody is already working on this please reply so we can share
thoughts and possible work.

Thank you and best regards,

